{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19652","headline":"奉和张舍人阁中直夜思闻雅琴因书事通简僚友 · 吕温","name":"奉和张舍人阁中直夜思闻雅琴因书事通简僚友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢递天上直，寂寞丘中琴。\n忆尔山水韵，起予仁智心。\n凝情在正始，超想疎烦襟。\n凉生子夜後，月照禁垣深。\n远风霭兰气，微露清桐阴。\n方袭缁衣庆，永奉南薰吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19652.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19652","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}